<title>JAPAN: Japan Sept external reserves at record $215.03 bln.</title>
<headline>Japan Sept external reserves at record $215.03 bln.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's external reserves rose $1.00 billion from a month earlier to a record $215.03 billion at the end of September, the Finance Ministry said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The reserves had increased $1.80 billion the previous month to a then record high of $214.03 billion.</p>
</text>
